<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Delete (254)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>delete self forever
</pre>
<p>A god's own character is deleted like any player's: type delete self 
forever, and the game warns you and asks you to say delete me (see <a cmd='#'>Help 
Delete</a>).
</p><p>Another player's character can't be deleted from inside the game: delete 
&lt;player&gt; only says so. That is done on the server, from the command 
prompt.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Delete</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Ban</a>
</pre>




</div>